|vague\",\"witnessId\":\"tp-1\",\"depth\":\"vague\",\"stanceHint\":\"answer\",\"truthLevel\":\"hint\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"tp-1|vague#1\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 한소정 증인은 넓은 범위의 흐름만 먼저 진술합니다. 새벽 호출과 출입기록, 초기 보안 보고 흐름을 안다고 진술합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"기억 범위를 넓게 잡아 말합니다. 초기 진술답게 조심스럽습니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:witness\",\"speaker:tp-1\",\"speakerRole:witness\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:재판관님\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:서윤아_씨_조태현_씨\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:witness_scope\",\"depth:vague\",\"stance:answer\",\"emotion:cautious\",\"continuity:surface_scope\",\"reveal:hint\",\"revealGuard:strict\",\"disclosure:guarded\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_testimony\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"witness:tp-1\"]},{\"id\":\"tp-1|vague#2\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 한소정 증인은 직접 본 부분과 들은 부분을 아직 넓게 묶어 말합니다. 새벽 호출과 출입기록, 초기 보안 보고 흐름을 안다고 진술합니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"기억 범위를 넓게 잡아 말합니다. 자기 위치를 의식하며 말합니다.\",\"tags\":[\"channel:witness\",\"speaker:tp-1\",\"speakerRole:witness\",\"listener:judge\",\"listenerRole:judge\",\"address:toJudge\",\"scope:judge_only\",\"revealScope:judge_only\",\"register:formal\",\"honorific:formal\",\"audience:single\",\"tense:present\",\"relationship:headline\",\"judgeAddress:재판관님\",\"judgeAddressState:defined\",\"callTerm:재판관님\",\"callTermState:defined\",\"counterpartyRef:서윤아_씨_조태현_씨\",\"counterpartyRefState:defined\",\"mentionTarget:witness_scope\",\"depth:vague\",\"stance:answer\",\"emotion:cautious\",\"continuity:surface_scope\",\"reveal:hint\",\"revealGuard:strict\",\"disclosure:guarded\",\"responseMode:judge_formal_testimony\"],\"sourceRefs\":[\"witness:tp-1\"]},{\"id\":\"tp-1|vague#3\",\"text\":\"재판관님, 한소정 증인은 아직 단정 대신 범위 설명에 머뭅니다. 핵심 흐름만 짚고 세부 확정은 미룹니다.\",\"behaviorHint\":\"기억 범위를 넓게 잡아 말합니다. 확정